# Extension UI & manifest

Docs: `docs/features/popup-ui.md`, `docs/features/options-api-key.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE-GUIDELINES.md`.

- Analyze: `chrome.scripting.executeScript` content script then MAIN `dom-updater` (see `EXTENSION_SCRIPT_PATHS`)
- Popup listens for `UPDATE_SUCCESS`, `LLM_ERROR`, `UPDATE_ERROR`
- Options: trim API key; storage key name `geminiApiKey`
- **extension/manifest.template.json**: bump version on release; tighten permissions only with strong justification
- CSP `connect-src` must allow Gemini when changing network targets
